    32  242e b12c                       LDA (ACCU),Y
    33  2430 38                         SEC
    34  2431 2a                         ROL
    35  2432 852c                       STA ACCU
    36  2434 842d                       STY ACCU + 1
    37  2436 262d                       ROL ACCU + 1
    38  2438 60                         RTS
